  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Danish Demining Group, DDG, Minr&#xf6;jning,2013/2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Demining Group,DDG,Mine clearance 2013/2014 - Danish Demining Group, DDG, Mine clearance Irak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom minr&#xf6;jning, utbildning och kapacitetsutveckling syftar Danish   Demining Group, DDG, utfasningsinsats 2013/2014 till att bidra till   en f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad humanit&#xe4;r situation f&#xf6;r de allra fattigaste och till en socio-ekonomisk utveckling i Basra, s&#xf6;dra Irak. DDG forts&#xe4;tter att    arbeta med en impact-styrd metod som utg&#xe5;r fr&#xe5;n lokala initiaitv som  inleddes 2010, och som erh&#xf6;ll st&#xf6;d av Sida.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through demining, training and capacity development Danish Demining   Group, DDG, aims their phase out project 2013/2014 to improve the     humanitarian situation of the poorest region in Basra, southern Iraq, as well as contribute to socio-economic development. DDG will         continue the impact-led and community focused approach initiated in   2010, which was supported by Sida.</narrative>
  </description>
